  <p id="c-songshu-074-wenhe-shen-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-074-wenhe-shen-family:p001:m0000" ref="16c_0og_lvl_A">沈攸之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-074-wenhe-shen-family:p001:m0004" ref="16c_0og_lvl_A">仲達</persName>，吳興武康人，司空<persName id="c-songshu-074-wenhe-shen-family:p001:m0015" ref="408_ce3_5d8">慶之</persName>從父兄子也。父<persName id="c-songshu-074-wenhe-shen-family:p001:m0024" ref="16c_0og_lvl">叔仁</persName>，為衡陽王<persName id="c-songshu-074-wenhe-shen-family:p001:m0031" ref="pon_7ik_t4l">義季</persName>征西長史，兼行參軍，領隊，又隨<persName id="c-songshu-074-wenhe-shen-family:p001:m0048" ref="pon_7ik_t4l">義季</persName>鎮彭城，度征北府。</p>
